The adaptation uses gpui-ohos native surfaces, GLES vertex buffers, shared
pipeline caches, sprite atlas and image-alpha flags. No gpui-fast core source
is modified. The frame graph, clip geometry and tile-cache protocol derive
from the upstream renderer. Files carry modification notices.
